  "pitfallsHtml": "<p>• <strong>Calling this \"not anaphylaxis\" because BP is normal-ish</strong> — anaphylaxis is a clinical diagnosis. Two-system involvement (skin + respiratory) in known allergic exposure = anaphylaxis<br>• Holding off on epi because patient took Benadryl<br>• Not asking about prior reactions<br>• Missing the unused EpiPen on the desk<br>• Forgetting nebulizer for the wheezing component</p>",
