  "pitfallsHtml": "<p>• <strong>Missing the pulsating mass</strong> — didn't palpate carefully or didn't consider AAA<br>• Treating as \"just stomach pain\" — vitals + tearing back-radiating pain in 69M smoker = vascular emergency<br>• Spending too long on scene<br>• Giving aspirin — wrong call in suspected AAA / GI bleed<br>• Not assessing pedal pulses bilaterally (asymmetry suggests aortic involvement)<br>• Forgetting NPO<br>• Letting him stand or walk to the stretcher</p>",
